  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41301" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Management of Aflatoxins in Eswatini</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.Conduct a national survey to establish the extent of aflatoxin exposure among the people of Eswatini
2.Develop awareness amongst the rural and urban population on aflatoxin, poisoning, prevention, control and its impacts and management (pre and post-harvest)
3.Build skills among farmer on aflatoxin  prevention and management (pre and post-harvest)
4.Strengthen the capacity of the Government testing laboratory to undertake quantitative analysis of a wide range of mycotoxins.</narrative>
  </description>
